# Почта (core/mail)

## Инвариант

Один механизм для всех компаний:

1. `CompanyMailConnection` — компания подключена к почтовому серверу (`mail_domain`, IMAP/SMTP, `provider`).
2. `MailboxBinding` — сотрудник (`kind=user`) или role-ящик (`kind=role`) привязан к адресу на этом сервере.
3. У одного `user_id` может быть **много** user-bindings; ровно один `is_default=true` среди них.
4. `company_id=system` — те же сущности; значения из `settings.mail.system` (auto-seed), PUT connection запрещён (только reconcile).
5. **Local-first:** UI/HTTP read только `mail_messages` / `mailbox_folders`. IMAP — sync, ensure, mutation confirm, IDLE wake.

Web `company.subdomain` ≠ `mail_domain`.

Crypto (S/MIME/PGP) — вне scope.

## Слои

| Модуль | Роль |
|---|---|
| `core/mail/models.py` | Pydantic-контракты, flags, list/search/move/star/draft/member payloads |
| `core/mail/ports.py` | `MailServerPort` Protocol |
| `core/mail/providers/*` | ISPmanager provision + generic IMAP/SMTP |
| `core/mail/transport/*` | aioimaplib / aiosmtplib + IDLE session |
| `core/mail/imip.py` | iMIP REQUEST ICS ↔ `CalendarEventUpsertPayload` |
| `core/mail/repositories.py` | shared DB CRUD + members + cursor page/search |
| `core/mail/service.py` | connect/bind/`sync_binding`/mutations/search |
| `core/api/mail.py` | HTTP (`/{svc}/api/mail/...`) |
| `platform-mail-modal` | кроссервисный UI (`modalKind=platform.mail`) |

Пароли ящиков и ISPmanager `authinfo_password` — Fernet; в API не отдаются.

## Auth

| Операция | Кто |
|---|---|
| `GET /connection`, `GET /bindings/me`, messages list/search/get/send/triage, `POST /sync`, `PUT .../default` | доступ: owner user-binding **или** role member **или** admin |
| `PATCH /bindings/{id}` только `calendar_color` | owner своего user-binding или admin |
| `PUT /connection`, `GET /bindings`, `POST/PATCH/DELETE /bindings*`, members ACL, healthcheck | `admin` активной компании |
| `POST /system/reconcile` | `company_id=system` + admin |

`GET /bindings/me` = собственные user-bindings ∪ role-bindings из `mailbox_binding_members`.

## Background sync (local-first)

| Слой | Что |
|---|---|
| Task | `mail_sync_tick` + `mail_sync_binding` + `mail_idle_supervisor` (`apps/idle_worker/tasks/`) |
| Schedule | cron `mail_sync` (default `*/1`); IDLE supervisor на том же cron при `idle_enabled` |
| Context | перед sync/mutations — `enter_mail_binding_context` + `build_job_context` (JWT): `MailService._active_user_id` и RAG/files/office; USER → owner mailbox, ROLE → member binding или любой member компании |
| Fairness | `list_sync_candidates` USER+ROLE; batch + drain |
| Folders cache | `mailbox_folders`; `GET /folders` DB-only (`stale`/`needs_sync`) |
| Messages | `mail_messages` + flags; list/search/thread/get — local |
| Sync fidelity | UIDVALIDITY wipe, forward catch-up, history backfill, UID reconcile, flag refresh |
| Sync-now | `POST /sync` → enqueue `mail_sync_binding` + refresh folders |
| Mutations | trash/move/archive/delete/star/drafts/seen — optimistic local + TaskIQ + push |
| Role ACL | `mailbox_binding_members`; RAG technical `mail-{mailbox_binding_id}` |
| Notify + live UI | `mail/message/upserted\|moved\|removed\|send_*` |
| Send | `prepare_send_local` (temp Sent uid) → enqueue SMTP+APPEND → sync |

Конфиг: `MailSyncConfig` (`backfill_batch_size`, `reconcile_every_n_syncs`, `idle_*`, …). Personal ns — **`namespace.mdc`**.

## Transport (`MailServerPort`)

list/fetch/send + `uid_store_flags`, `uid_move`, `uid_expunge`, `append_message`, `uid_search`, `fetch_flags_for_uids`, `open_idle_session`.

Wire folder = exact IMAP name; роли только SPECIAL-USE. Ensure: sent/drafts/trash/archive.

## Schema extras

- `mail_messages`: `flagged`, `answered`, `draft`; `user_id` nullable (role)
- `mailbox_sync_cursors`: `backfill_completed`, `oldest_uid`, `last_reconcile_at`
- `mailbox_binding_members`: PK `(mailbox_binding_id, user_id)`, `role ∈ {member, manager}`

## Provision

- **System**: `reconcile_system` / `ensure_system_*` — connection + role boxes; members через `ensure_system_user_bindings`.
- **Prod K8s**: `mail.system.enabled` + hosts/user в `deploy/helm/agent-lab/files/app-conf.k8s-overlay.json`; `authinfo_password` — GitHub Secret `MAIL__SYSTEM__ISPMANAGER__AUTHINFO_PASSWORD` → `platform-secrets` → ENV. Frontend lifespan вызывает `reconcile_system` при `enabled=true`.
- **Lazy**: `MailService.get_or_create_user_binding(user_id)`.
- `bind_mailbox` на существующий email: тот же owner/role → idempotent; иначе admin reassign.
- `ispmanager` `ensure_mailbox` — create-if-missing.
- `delete_mailbox` — `assert_mailbox_delete_allowed`.

## UI

`openModal('platform.mail')`. State: `state.mail` + `createMailEffect`.

Rail (`<platform-mail-calendar-rail>`): user + role bindings (role mark); Mail↔Calendar switcher.

Reading:
- list/thread local; Refresh → `SYNC_REQUESTED`; empty → `needs_sync` + auto sync;
- search → `POST /messages/search`; load more → cursor;
- triage: star / archive / trash / delete forever; shortcuts E / # / S;
- drafts folder open → compose; compose autosave draft.

Settings:
- **Мои ящики**: цвет, default (user);
- **Ящики компании** (admin): assign/reassign user; create user|role; role members add/remove;
- **Почтовый сервер** (admin): connection + healthcheck.

Compose: `<platform-markdown-editor variant="compose">`; outbound attachments local base64.

Inbound attachments: `<platform-file-attachments>` по `file_id`.

`MailboxBinding.calendar_color` — ключ палитры. `CalendarEvent.mailbox_binding_id` — ленточка календаря.

Deep-link: `notify/mail/mail_new_message_received` → `OPEN_FROM_NOTIFICATION`.

## HTTP (зеркало UI)

| Path | Назначение |
|---|---|
| `POST /messages/list`, `/messages/search`, `/messages/thread` | local read |
| `POST /sync` | sync-now |
| `POST /messages/mark_seen\|mark_unseen\|trash\|archive\|delete\|star\|move\|drafts\|send` | mutations |
| `GET/POST/DELETE /bindings/{id}/members` | role ACL |

## iMIP

iMIP REQUEST → calendar upsert с `mailbox_binding_id` письма.

## Conf и креды

Секция `mail` / ENV `MAIL__*` / GitHub Secrets `MAIL_ISPMANAGER_*` — см. `tests/core/mail/README.md`.  
Hosts: hostname панели (`sm36.hosting.reg.ru`), не `mail.linnex.io` если A-запись на IP платформы.  
Исходящий SMTP часто режет **VPN** — live send гонять без VPN или с VPS.

